    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is an action game focused on combat, where a girl returns from the abyss to explore her own secrets and redemption, trapped in a cycle of battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2654350/extras/45e7999b3a2f1f32d2a6e4d3bf0eff0f.avif?t=1750653637\" width=500 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge enemies with different combat styles, proficiently use your abilities, enhance attributes, match runes, and defeat enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2654350/extras/b2a91dfe3d5632bf9230fa49f508e993.avif?t=1750653637\" width=500 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The selection of artifacts is crucial, as each artifact has unique performance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2654350/extras/a2a6345e28e67c9427dd318838c44fb3.avif?t=1750653637\" width=500 height=200 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock runes and freely match them to create a suitable combat style</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Various exciting bosses await your challenge</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique gameplay style</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combination of melee, ranged, and artifact, with diverse attack methods</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is an action game focused on combat, where a girl returns from the abyss to explore her own secrets and redemption, trapped in a cycle of battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2654350/extras/45e7999b3a2f1f32d2a6e4d3bf0eff0f.avif?t=1750653637\" width=500 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge enemies with different combat styles, proficiently use your abilities, enhance attributes, match runes, and defeat enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2654350/extras/b2a91dfe3d5632bf9230fa49f508e993.avif?t=1750653637\" width=500 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The selection of artifacts is crucial, as each artifact has unique performance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2654350/extras/a2a6345e28e67c9427dd318838c44fb3.avif?t=1750653637\" width=500 height=200 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock runes and freely match them to create a suitable combat style</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Various exciting bosses await your challenge</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique gameplay style</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combination of melee, ranged, and artifact, with diverse attack methods</p></li></ul>",
